Description:It is your first main phase. You are at 20 life and control Thermo-Alchemist, Goblin Electromancer and an untapped Mountain. Your hand is Lava Spike, Gitaxian Probe, Mutagenic Growth and Fling. The opponent is at 11 life and controls nothing. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-hard-alchemist-interleave | Thermo-Alchemist untaps whenever you cast an instant or sorcery, so tapping it before each spell pings once per spell plus once more: four pings, Lava Spike for 3, and Electromancer attacking as a 4/4 after Mutagenic Growth is exactly 11; casting the spells first pings once (8), and Fling on the Electromancer gives up the Spike and the attack
