[solution]
# Tap Thermo-Alchemist before each spell: it untaps on every instant or sorcery, so three spells ping four times.
# Gitaxian Probe and Mutagenic Growth are paid with 2 life each; Electromancer attacks as a 4/4: 4 + 3 + 4 = 11.
activate Thermo-Alchemist
cast Lava Spike
opponent
activate Thermo-Alchemist
cast Gitaxian Probe
opponent
activate Thermo-Alchemist
cast Mutagenic Growth
Goblin Electromancer
activate Thermo-Alchemist
Goblin Electromancer
[acceptance]
life p1 <= 0
